Description: Interactive Shiny app for PCoA, alpha diversity (LMM),
    taxonomy bar plots, beta diversity statistics, MaAsLin3
    differential abundance analysis of microbiome data, and linear (mixed)
    models and descriptive statistics for targeted measurements such as
    qPCR and metabolites.
